- Hello. - Hi.

1816
01:12:36,327 --> 01:12:37,996
Hello.

1817
01:12:37,997 --> 01:12:39,096
Hello.

1818
01:12:39,097 --> 01:12:41,197
- Hello. - Oh, hello.

1819
01:12:42,037 --> 01:12:43,466
Oh, hello.

1820
01:12:43,467 --> 01:12:44,537
