1833
01:13:07,927 --> 01:13:09,496
- Gosh, it looks good. - You came here last time too.

1834
01:13:09,497 --> 01:13:10,926
- That's right. - You came here before?

1835
01:13:10,927 --> 01:13:11,996
I did.

1836
01:13:11,997 --> 01:13:13,567
- You're a regular here. - I came here.

1837
01:13:14,967 --> 01:13:16,766
- Goodness. - Gosh, it's good.

1838
01:13:16,767 --> 01:13:18,466
- Goodness. What do I do? - It's really good.

1839
01:13:18,467 --> 01:13:19,536
