- Spam. - Spam. What else?

1848
01:13:34,357 --> 01:13:35,687
- Tteokgalbi. - Tteokgalbi?

1849
01:13:35,787 --> 01:13:36,927
That? Okay.

1850
01:13:37,287 --> 01:13:38,386
- What else? - Are you treating me?

1851
01:13:38,387 --> 01:13:40,426
Yes, it's on me.

1852
01:13:40,427 --> 01:13:42,296
- Are you treating me? - Yes, it's on me.

1853
01:13:42,297 --> 01:13:43,367
I can't believe it.

1854
01:13:43,467 --> 01:13:45,396
- Are you really treating me? - I will.

1855
01:13:45,397 --> 01:13:46,896
