1856
01:13:46,897 --> 01:13:48,037
Go ahead and eat.

1857
01:13:48,167 --> 01:13:50,506
It must be a first for Yun Hwa.

1858
01:13:50,507 --> 01:13:52,407
- I know. It's really strange. - I know.

1859
01:13:52,667 --> 01:13:53,807
I can't believe it.

1860
