1862
01:13:59,917 --> 01:14:01,347
That must be so good, Yun Hwa!

1863
01:14:02,647 --> 01:14:04,517
- Gosh, look. That's so much. - Thank you.

1864
01:14:05,017 --> 01:14:07,116
She gave us this and fishcake too.

1865
01:14:07,117 --> 01:14:09,457
- Goodness. - She put it in tteokbokki.

1866
01:14:10,727 --> 01:14:12,357
- Goodness. - That looks good.

1867
01:14:13,597 --> 01:14:14,756
Gosh, the gimmari is filled.

1868
01:14:14,757 --> 01:14:16,157
Gosh, the gimmari looks good.

1869
