I should be careful.

1871
01:14:24,467 --> 01:14:25,936
(It's even more delicious because Woo Il bought it for me.)

1872
01:14:25,937 --> 01:14:27,007
It's so good.

1873
01:14:31,447 --> 01:14:32,547
It's so good.

1874
01:14:33,477 --> 01:14:35,216
- It's really good. - Thank you.

1875
01:14:35,217 --> 01:14:37,147
