1895
01:15:18,627 --> 01:15:20,056
- Gosh, he must've never paid. - Gosh.

1896
01:15:20,057 --> 01:15:21,797
- This way, you will... - You need to leave proof.

1897
01:15:22,257 --> 01:15:24,567
