1911
01:16:01,297 --> 01:16:02,866
- Thank you. - Thank you.

1912
01:16:02,867 --> 01:16:03,936
- Thank you. - It was delicious.

1913
01:16:03,937 --> 01:16:05,306
- Have a good one. - I enjoyed it, Woo Il.

1914
01:16:05,307 --> 01:16:06,367
All right.

1915
