1920
01:16:19,717 --> 01:16:22,117
(Jade Emperor Moomoo)

1921
01:16:23,224 --> 01:16:26,224
Gosh, it'll be really good if you grill that fish.

1922
01:16:26,997 --> 01:16:28,089
It's amazing. Gosh, sushi!

1923
