Sir, we'll take three bags of rice puffs.

1931
01:16:50,317 --> 01:16:51,162
- Three? - Yes.

1932
01:16:51,947 --> 01:16:53,086
Hold on. This...

1933
01:16:53,087 --> 01:16:54,157
