Look at her face. She's serious.

1937
01:17:02,457 --> 01:17:05,197
- Yes, she's not trying to be funny. - She's not.

1938
01:17:05,451 --> 01:17:07,750
No, Woo Il. You spent 19 dollars today.

1939
01:17:07,751 --> 01:17:08,950
