1943
01:17:13,791 --> 01:17:14,990
- So... - "Woo Il finally treated me."

1944
01:17:14,991 --> 01:17:16,700
- Like this? - "Woo Il treated me to a meal."

1945
01:17:16,701 --> 01:17:19,000
And people will go, "Oh, my. Really? He must be crazy."

1946
01:17:19,001 --> 01:17:20,271
"My goodness. I can't believe it."

1947
01:17:20,401 --> 01:17:23,371
I think there will be a notice about it in the comedian group chat.

1948
01:17:25,641 --> 01:17:28,310
- You spent a lot. - Gosh, Woo Il, what's wrong?

1949
01:17:28,311 --> 01:17:30,040
I'll pay for it.

1950
