- Woo Il. - You can pay for the groceries.

1951
01:17:32,781 --> 01:17:34,251
Aren't you spending too much?

1952
01:17:34,351 --> 01:17:37,781
I can spend that much because Yun Hwa helped me a lot.

1953
01:17:38,381 --> 01:17:40,250
