1954
01:17:40,251 --> 01:17:41,290
This place is really good.

1955
01:17:41,291 --> 01:17:42,351
I'll get going, sir!

1956
01:17:42,991 --> 01:17:43,991
Bye.

1957
01:17:44,661 --> 01:17:46,830
