1998
01:19:07,671 --> 01:19:08,771
It's that dried lavers.

1999
01:19:09,311 --> 01:19:10,980
I got you the dried lavers.

2000
01:19:10,981 --> 01:19:12,611
- Oh, my. - My goodness.

2001
01:19:12,781 --> 01:19:14,250
They're all cut,

2002
