It's not iffy.

2013
01:19:37,441 --> 01:19:39,470
I got nine, so that's more than enough, isn't it?

2014
01:19:39,471 --> 01:19:40,911
- It's iffy. - It is.

2015
01:19:41,941 --> 01:19:43,210
One of us will take just one.

2016
