Someone has to take one pack.

2017
01:19:45,511 --> 01:19:46,680
I'll just take one.

2018
01:19:46,681 --> 01:19:47,750
- No, I'll take one. - No, let me.

2019
01:19:47,751 --> 01:19:48,751
- I... - I'm serious.

2020
01:19:48,752 --> 01:19:49,950
- I won't take it. - I'll take just one.

2021
01:19:49,951 --> 01:19:51,550
- Forget it. - What will that make Hyun Moo?

2022
01:19:51,551 --> 01:19:52,750
- It's really fine. - You take it.

2023
01:19:52,751 --> 01:19:54,750
- It's okay. - You guys can take it.

2024
01:19:54,751 --> 01:19:56,691
Don't get me wrong. I don't really like dried lavers.

2025
01:19:56,821 --> 01:19:57,860
(Yum)

2026
01:19:57,861 --> 01:19:59,090
There's a Korean...

2027
01:19:59,091 --> 01:20:00,390
- who doesn't like dried lavers? - Yes, me.

2028
01:20:00,391 --> 01:20:02,490
- I don't like dried lavers. - It gets awkward.

2029
