I know. Who's going to take two?

2030
01:20:04,461 --> 01:20:06,060
- And who will take one? - I'll take one.

2031
01:20:06,061 --> 01:20:07,231
It's really iffy.

2032
01:20:07,971 --> 01:20:09,430
- What do we do? - Let's just take them.

2033
01:20:09,431 --> 01:20:11,141
- Can we? Can we take them? - Yes, let's take one each.

2034
01:20:11,271 --> 01:20:12,871
It's the thought that counts.

2035
01:20:12,941 --> 01:20:15,770
Goodness. Thank you, Woo Il.

2036
01:20:15,771 --> 01:20:17,980
- And it's vacuum-sealed. - Grilled lavers from a market.

2037
01:20:17,981 --> 01:20:19,010
- Thank you. - Goodness.

2038
01:20:19,011 --> 01:20:20,350
Thank you for this, Woo Il.

2039
01:20:20,351 --> 01:20:21,710
Thank you so much, Woo Il.

2040
01:20:21,711 --> 01:20:23,011
Thank you.

2041
01:20:23,581 --> 01:20:25,020
This is too good to eat.

2042
01:20:25,021 --> 01:20:26,250
I should take a photo of this as proof.

2043
01:20:26,251 --> 01:20:27,550
Yes, I'm going to frame it.

2044
01:20:27,551 --> 01:20:28,720
I think we can do that.

2045
01:20:28,721 --> 01:20:29,920
- This is... - Yes.

2046
01:20:29,921 --> 01:20:31,990
more precious than Lingard's uniform.

2047
01:20:31,991 --> 01:20:33,020
- Gosh, of course it is. - Of course.

2048
01:20:33,021 --> 01:20:34,291
