- Sign your autograph here. - Please sign here.

2051
01:20:38,001 --> 01:20:39,331
(Sign your autograph here liker Lingard did.)

2052
01:20:39,661 --> 01:20:41,200
- That's right. - Sign one for me too!

2053
01:20:41,201 --> 01:20:42,631
- Sign your autograph here. - Here.

2054
01:20:42,871 --> 01:20:44,271
How can we eat it?

2055
01:20:44,401 --> 01:20:46,370
- I can't eat it. - How can we eat it?

2056
01:20:46,371 --> 01:20:47,371
Laminate it.

2057
01:20:49,741 --> 01:20:52,441
(Their hands are full in no time.)

2058
01:20:52,941 --> 01:20:54,511
- Let's go now, Woo Il. - All right.

2059
01:20:56,781 --> 01:20:57,880
Gosh, that was great.

2060
01:20:57,881 --> 01:20:59,181
